  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>C</mtext> <mo>&#8853;</mo> </mover> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>&#8596;</mo> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>C</mtext> <mo>&#8853;</mo> </mover> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (I)&nbsp; (Stabilised by delocalisation ( 2 eq. R.S.)&nbsp;)<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mtext>C</mtext> <mo>&#8853;</mo> </mover> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp; (Stabilised by only + I &amp; hyperconjugation)(2 conjugated C-H)<br /><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0350_720ebae1bda4.png\" style=\"width: 578px; height: 185px;\" /><br /><br /><br />III is stabilised by maximum delocalisation ( 4&nbsp;R.S.)<br /><br />The order of stability is III &gt; I &gt; II<br /><br />Order of stability is:<br /><img height=\"185\" src=\"assets\\st0350_c988fa2af090.png\" width=\"490\" /></p>"
  }
